  "version": "0.1.0",
  "title": "RGB LED colour mixing on a Nano",
  "summary": "An Arduino Nano mixes colours on a 5 mm common-cathode RGB LED using PWM on D9 (red), D10 (green) and D11 (blue) through 220 Ω and 150 Ω resistors.",
